# Vile OS archiso packages — v2 plan (Nov 10, 2026)
#
# Pure Arch, kernel-first. The ISO starts from Arch's own packages only:
#   linux (the kernel) + base + systemd + pacman — NO prebuilt Arch system
#   (no EndeavourOS, CachyOS, Garuda, or any other Arch-based distro).
#
# The desktop is the VILE COMPOSITOR (compositor/, our own # compositor, built from source) — NOT the hyprland package. The old v1
# list (hyprland, hyprpaper, hyprlock, hypridle, waybar, eww, wofi,
# nwg-dock-hyprland) is kept below under HOLD: those pieces only come back
# if a later compositor piece needs them, and waybar/eww/dock are NOT
# tested as if Hyprland were the compositor.
#
# STATUS: wlroots 0.19.3 is built from source (Arch dropped the unversioned
# `wlroots` package Nov 2026 — only wlroots0.20 remains, and the compositor
# needs the 0.19 API). See build-env/wlroots-0.19.3.tar.gz + the staged
# files under archiso/airootfs/usr/local/. NOT yet used to build an ISO.
# Piece 1 (compositor + wallpaper) is proven headless on Ubuntu; the ISO
# build + QEMU boot test is Piece 6. Do not present this as working
# until mkarchiso has actually run and the ISO has booted.

# --- Piece 0: kernel + base (the foundation, nothing else first) --------
linux
linux-firmware
intel-ucode
amd-ucode
base
base-devel
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
pacman
archiso
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
nbd
grub
syslinux
memtest86+
efibootmgr
networkmanager
iwd
openssh
sudo
vim
nano
git
curl
unzip

# --- Vile compositor: runtime deps (wlroots stack, from Arch repos) -----
# NOTE: wlroots itself is NOT in this list — Arch removed the `wlroots`
# package; the compositor needs 0.19.3, built from source and shipped in
# airootfs/usr/local/ (lib + headers + wlroots-0.19.pc). Its runtime deps
# below ARE Arch packages.
wayland
wayland-protocols
libdrm
libdisplay-info
pixman
libinput
libxkbcommon
seatd
mesa
vulkan-icd-loader
xkeyboard-config

# --- Vile compositor: build deps (compositor/ is built from source) -----
meson
ninja
gcc
pkg-config

# --- Test tools (screenshot proof + a terminal for Piece 2) --------------
foot
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard

# --- Fonts + theme (Vile look: Inter + JetBrains Mono, purple dark) ------
noto-fonts
pango
cairo
noto-fonts-emoji
inter-font
ttf-jetbrains-mono
adw-gtk-theme
gtk3
python
python-gobject
python-cairo
# Vile Settings: PIL crops/resizes the profile picture
python-pillow

# --- Audio / media (needed by later pieces, harmless now) ----------------
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-alsa
wireplumber
polkit
polkit-gnome
brightnessctl
playerctl
thunar
thunar-archive-plugin
xorg-xrandr

# --- HOLD (v1 Hyprland-based stack — NOT the compositor, do not install
# --- as the desktop. Kept here so the decision is on the record.) --------
